
 ⏺ [1;4mReading the session layer[0m

   The [1msession layer[0m wraps [3mthe SDK[0m so the interface never touches a process. Start with src/session/session.ts, then
   see the [4mACP spec[0;2m (https://agentclientprotocol.com)[0m for the wire format.

   [1mWhat it does[0m

   [2m- [0mopens one persistent session per chord session
   [2m- [0mstarts turns with startTurn and cancels them
   [2m  1. [0ma cancel stops the turn at once
   [2m  2. [0mthe agent is told with session/cancel
   [2m- [0mcloses the agent and waits until its exit is seen

   [2m│ [3mA closed agent counts as gone only once its exit is seen:[0m
